### 测试 AI 爆文智能创作平台 - 用户管理模块

### 服务健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/
Accept: application/json

### 注册
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "password": "test123456",
  "nickname": "小美"
}

### 登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "13800138000",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### 获取当前用户信息（需替换 TOKEN）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 修改个人信息
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "小红书美妆博主小美",
  "bio": "3万粉丝美妆博主，专注干货分享"
}

### 修改密码
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/user/password
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "test123456",
  "new_password": "newpass888"
}

### 登出
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 注销账号
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/user/account
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### ============ 内容创作模块 ============

### 生成爆款选题（需登录）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/content/topics
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "AI工具提升效率",
  "platform": "小红书"
}

### SSE 流式创作（浏览器/EventSource 使用，用 URL 传 token）
# 注意：此接口返回 text/event-stream，REST Client 无法直接友好展示，建议用浏览器测试
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/content/generate?keyword=AI工具提升效率&platform=小红书&selected_title=打工人偷偷用的AI工具&token=<TOKEN>

### 历史记录列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/content/tasks
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 历史记录详情
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/content/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
